  "label": "Meme Culture",
  "description": "A social and internet-based phenomenon characterized by the rapid creation, sharing, and modification of humorous or satirical images, often with text overlays. Memes are used to comment on current events, social issues, or to express shared humor, but can also be used to spread offensive or harmful content. The meme in question is a product of this culture, using visual and textual elements to convey a specific attitude.",
